<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: ICE HOCKEY-FINLAND BEAT THE CZECH REPUBLIC.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-FINLAND BEAT THE CZECH REPUBLIC.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland beat the Czech Republic</p>
<p>2-1 (1-0 1-0 0-1) in an ice hockey friendly on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Czech Republic - Jiri Dopita 44</p>
<p>Finland - Raimo Helminen 4, Marko Kiprusoff 32</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
</text>
